---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Big-O Complexity Calculator" description="Learn about our Big-O Calculator tool and its mission to help developers write efficient code.">
  <main class="container">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <h1>About Big-O Complexity Calculator</h1>
      
      <section>
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>We believe that every developer should understand algorithmic complexity. Our mission is to make Big-O notation accessible, intuitive, and actionable through an interactive AI-powered analysis tool.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Why We Built This</h2>
        <p>Understanding code complexity is crucial for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Writing scalable applications that handle millions of users</li>
          <li>Optimizing performance in resource-constrained environments</li>
          <li>Making informed technical decisions</li>
          <li>Acing technical interviews at top companies</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <p>Our tool combines:</p>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>AI Analysis:</strong> Google's Gemini API analyzes your code and identifies complexity patterns</li>
          <li><strong>Visual Graphs:</strong> See how your algorithm compares to common complexity classes</li>
          <li><strong>Educational Content:</strong> Learn why your code has that complexity and how to improve it</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Technologies</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Frontend: Astro.js with React components</li>
          <li>Backend: Python with Flask</li>
          <li>AI: Google Gemini Flash API</li>
          <li>Visualization: Chart.js for complexity graphs</li>
          <li>Code Editor: Prism.js syntax highlighting</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <style>
    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .content-wrapper {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      border: 1px solid #16213e;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #00d4ff;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #00d4ff;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    p, li {
      color: #ddd;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    ul, ol {
      margin-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>